SUMMARY:Crossing & Aerial Duels
LOCATION:Harry Downes Field
DESCRIPTION:Skills:\nGetting to the byline and delivering a low cut-back\nL
 ate run from midfield to meet the cut-back and shoot\nHolding a defensive l
 ine as runners attack the cut-back\nFirst-time finish from a low cut-back a
 cross the box\nDisguising cross direction to delay the defensive shift\nCov
 ering the cut-back channel as a defending fullback
