SUMMARY:1v1 Attacking vs. Defending
LOCATION:Park School
DESCRIPTION:Skills:\nPressing trigger: when and how to press the ball\nEsca
 pe from a press: one-touch away from pressure\nBall protection on the dribb
 le in a high-pressure situation\nCoordinated pressing as a pair to cut off 
 passing lanes\nWinning the ball back high up the pitch from the front\nCoun
 tering immediately after winning possession in the press
END:VEVENT
